# Festag — dark-mode CTAs

Dark mode: **no colored button fills** on auth. Ready = warm bone; idle = quiet ghost.

## Auth geometry

```css
border-radius: 8px; /* serious soft rect — not pills */
height: 40px;       /* inputs 42px */
```

## Idle / secondary (dark auth)

Google, Apple, SSO, idle Weiter — transparent + hairline, muted ink:

```css
background: transparent;
color: rgba(228, 228, 234, 0.62);
border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
```

Brand icons idle at ~38–42% opacity; lift on hover.

## Ready / primary (dark)

```css
background: #EBE8E3; /* warm bone */
color: #1A1917;
border: 1px solid transparent;
box-shadow: none;
```

Hover `#DDD9D2` / active `#D0CBC3`.

## Do not

- Filled primary-blue Google on auth
- Bright white idle icons
- Full-pill `999px` on auth CTAs/inputs
- Drop auth radius back to marketing pills without an explicit ask

Portal dark primaries may still use soft cool-white `#F0F2F5` where not on auth chrome.
